      "hints": [
        "For a uniform field between parallel plates, relate field strength to potential difference and plate separation.",
        "Rearrange E = V / d to make d the subject before substituting the given values."
      ],
      "walkthrough": [
        "For a uniform field, the potential difference between parallel plates is V = Ed.",
        "Rearrange to d = V / E.",
        "Substitute d = 350 / (1.4 × 10⁴) m = 0.025 m.",
        "The plate separation is 0.025 m."
      ],
