            "criterion_id": "9702_m20_22_q06_b_i_mp02",
            "observable": "Calculates Q = 4.8 × 10⁻¹⁹ C and divides it by 1.6 × 10⁻¹⁹ C to express the charge in elementary-charge units."
          },
